---
import {getEntry} from 'astro:content';
import {summit2026Highlights} from '../../data/summit-2026';
import EventHero from '../../components/legacy/EventHero.astro';
import MediaBlock from '../../components/legacy/MediaBlock.astro';
import Section from '../../components/legacy/Section.astro';
import LegacyLayout from '../../layouts/LegacyLayout.astro';

const event = await getEntry('pastEvents', 'xen-summit-2026');
if (!event) throw new Error('Missing Xen Summit 2026 archive entry');
const {title, description, keywords, eventDates, eventLocation} = event.data;
const talksUrl = 'https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLGe6RWOETgTQ';
const scheduleUrl = 'https://xensummit2026.sched.com/';
const highlightVideoId = summit2026Highlights.videoId;
const highlightEmbedUrl = `https://www.youtube.com/embed/${highlightVideoId}?rel=0`;
---

<LegacyLayout {title} {description} {keywords} socialImage="/assets/summit-2026/social-card.jpg">
  <article class="article page-single summit-recap">
    <div class="single-content">
      <EventHero
        eyebrow="Past event · Community recap"
        {title}
        locationDate={`${eventLocation} · ${eventDates}`}
        format="Three days of talks, technical discussion, design sessions, and community collaboration."
        backgroundSrc="/assets/summit-2026/hero.webp"
        backgroundMobileSrc="/assets/summit-2026/hero-mobile.webp"
        backgroundAlt="Munich cityscape artwork for Xen Summit 2026"
        ctas={[
          {label: 'Summit highlights', href: '#highlights', variant: 'primary'},
          {label: 'Watch all talks', href: talksUrl, variant: 'secondary'},
        ]}
      />

      <Section class="content-markdown summit-recap-intro">
        <p>Xen Summit 2026 brought together developers, maintainers, users, researchers, and organizations from across the Xen ecosystem for three days of talks, technical discussion, design sessions, and community collaboration.</p>
        <p>Hosted by Renesas at the HEAS office in Aschheim, near Munich, the Summit took place on September 15–17, 2026: two days of talks followed by a design day. Thank you to everyone who contributed, spoke, and participated.</p>
        <p class="uno-text-sm">Explore the recap: <a href="#highlights">Highlights</a> · <a href="#program">Talks and program</a> · <a href="#design-sessions">Design day</a> · <a href="#venue">Venue</a> · <a href="#sponsors">Sponsors</a></p>
      </Section>

      <Section class="summit-highlights">
        <div id="highlights" class="summit-highlights-panel">
          <MediaBlock
            title="Xen Summit 2026 highlights"
            label={`The Summit in ${summit2026Highlights.duration}`}
            media={highlightEmbedUrl}
            alt="Xen Summit 2026 highlight film"
            mediaPosition="right"
            plainContent
          >
            <p>A short look back at the people, conversations, and collaboration that brought the Xen community together in Munich.</p>
            <p class="uno-mt-5"><a href={talksUrl} class="btn btn-primary">Watch all talks</a></p>
            <p class="uno-mt-4"><a href={`https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=${highlightVideoId}`}>Watch the highlight film on YouTube</a></p>
          </MediaBlock>
        </div>
      </Section>

      <Section class="content-markdown">
        <h2 id="program">Talks and program</h2>
        <p>The September 15–16 program covered Xen development, embedded and automotive virtualization, safety, security, cloud infrastructure, Arm platforms, tooling, testing, and real-world deployments.</p>
        <div class="uno-grid uno-grid-cols-1 md:uno-grid-cols-2 uno-gap-6">
          <div class="uno-card"><h3>Watch the recordings</h3><p>Catch up on the technical talks and revisit discussions from across the Xen ecosystem.</p><p><a href={talksUrl}>Watch all Xen Summit 2026 talks</a></p></div>
          <div class="uno-card"><h3>Revisit the program</h3><p>Browse the original agenda, session descriptions, and speaker information on Sched.</p><p><a href={scheduleUrl}>View the program and speakers</a></p></div>
        </div>
      </Section>

      <Section class="content-markdown">
        <h2 id="design-sessions">Design day</h2>
        <p>September 17 was dedicated to design sessions, project planning, and collaboration. These working discussions gave contributors and users time to work through project direction, architecture, implementation plans, and community process face to face.</p>
        <p>Design sessions are a central part of Xen Summit: a space to coordinate future features, share experience, and work through technical questions together.</p>
        <p><a href={scheduleUrl}>Explore the Summit agenda</a> for session context, or continue the conversation through the <a href="/resources/mailing-lists/">Xen Project mailing lists</a>.</p>
      </Section>

      <Section class="content-markdown">
        <h2 id="venue">Venue and host</h2>
        <p>Renesas hosted Xen Summit 2026 at the HEAS office in Aschheim, directly across from the Renesas Munich office.</p>
        <p>Einsteinring 30, 85609 Aschheim, Germany · <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/4h4E7zzcBjJuiecK9">Venue on Google Maps</a></p>
      </Section>

      <Section class="section-square-rounded content-markdown">
        <h2 id="sponsors">Sponsors</h2>
        <p>Thank you to the organizations that supported Xen Summit 2026.</p>
        <div class="uno-my-16 uno-rounded-xl uno-border uno-border-brand-fill/30 uno-bg-brand-fill/8 uno-px-6 uno-py-12 md:uno-px-10">
          <h3 class="txt-c uno-mt-0">Platinum Sponsors</h3>
          <div class="uno-grid uno-grid-cols-1 md:uno-grid-cols-2 uno-items-center uno-justify-items-center uno-gap-12 uno-mt-10"><a href="https://www.renesas.com/" class="uno-block uno-w-full uno-max-w-[400px] uno-text-center"><img src="/img/logos/renesas-logo.svg" alt="Renesas logo" class="uno-w-full uno-h-auto" /></a><a href="https://www.honda.com/" class="uno-block uno-w-full uno-max-w-[400px] uno-text-center"><img src="/img/logos/honda-logo.svg" alt="Honda logo" class="uno-w-full uno-h-auto" /></a></div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="txt-c">Gold Sponsors</h3>
        <div class="uno-grid uno-grid-cols-1 md:uno-grid-cols-2 uno-items-center uno-justify-items-center uno-gap-10 uno-my-12"><a href="https://www.xenserver.com/" class="uno-block uno-w-full uno-max-w-[300px] uno-text-center"><img src="/img/logos/xenserver-logo.svg" alt="XenServer logo" class="uno-w-full uno-h-auto" /></a><a href="https://www.arm.com/" class="uno-block uno-w-full uno-max-w-[300px] uno-text-center"><img src="/img/logos/arm-logo.svg" alt="Arm logo" class="uno-w-full uno-h-auto" /></a></div>
        <h3 class="txt-c">Silver Sponsors</h3>
        <div class="uno-grid uno-grid-cols-1 md:uno-grid-cols-2 uno-items-center uno-justify-items-center uno-gap-8 uno-my-10"><a href="https://vates.tech/" class="uno-block uno-w-full uno-max-w-[260px] uno-text-center"><img src="/img/logos/vates-logo.svg" alt="Vates logo" class="uno-w-full uno-h-auto" /></a><a href="https://www.bugseng.com/" class="uno-block uno-w-full uno-max-w-[260px] uno-text-center"><img src="/img/logos/bugseng-logo.svg" alt="BUGSENG logo" class="uno-w-full uno-h-auto" /></a></div>
        <h3 class="txt-c">Bronze Sponsors</h3>
        <div class="uno-grid uno-grid-cols-1 uno-items-center uno-justify-items-center uno-gap-6 uno-my-8"><a href="https://edera.dev/" class="uno-block uno-w-full uno-max-w-[220px] uno-rounded-lg uno-bg-gray-950 uno-p-4 uno-text-center"><img src="/img/summit-sponsors/2026/edera-logo-light.svg" alt="Edera logo" class="uno-w-full uno-h-auto" /></a></div>
      </Section>

      <Section class="content-markdown">
        <h2>Continue the conversation</h2>
        <p>Connect with the community on <a href="/resources/matrix/">Matrix</a> or the <a href="/resources/mailing-lists/">mailing lists</a>. The <a href="/contribute/code-of-conduct/">Xen Project Code of Conduct</a> guides participation in our community.</p>
        <p><a href="/resources/past-events/">Browse all past Xen Project events</a></p>
      </Section>
    </div>
  </article>
</LegacyLayout>

<style>
  .summit-recap :global(.uno-section) { min-height: auto; }
  .summit-highlights-panel :global(.media-block__media) { padding: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .summit-highlights-panel :global(.media-block__media),
    .summit-highlights-panel :global(.media-block__content) {
      flex-basis: 100%;
      min-width: 0;
    }
  }

  .summit-recap-intro { padding-bottom: 0; }
  .summit-highlights-panel {
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: var(--color-brand-surface);
  }
  #highlights { scroll-margin-top: 6rem; }
</style>
